From e72a2c224d1334b041d648dd7c9d34b7f0ae694a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tmp <tmp@x>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:51:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] am243x: enet: Add combined CPSW + ICSSG library and example

Add the enet-cpsw-icssg library for AM243x R5F. It builds the Enet LLD
with both ENET_ENABLE_PER_CPSW and ENET_ENABLE_PER_ICSSG so one core
can open CPSW and ICSSG peripherals at the same time. The file list is
the union of enet-cpsw and enet-icssg plus enet_ioctl_register_multi.c,
which dispatches the IOCTL registration shared by both families.

Register the library and the enet_layer2_icssg_cpsw example (AM243x
EVM) with the build-file generator, and add the generated makefiles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DbJ6cEKniwyDR9YBttBJEK
